              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wek rok ducu doŋ gumukke, gubin, gubin kany wa i nota pa Yekocapat; an abibedo piny kunnu ka ŋolo kop ki rok ducu ma orumo kany.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.12",
