              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kit meno wubiŋeyo ni an a Rwot Lubaŋawu, ma abedo i Cion ma got mera maleŋ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.17"
            ]
